.....bbbbbb.....

# Halloween: dark crown with a mid-gray G rim, tip bent right, yellow band,
# wide brim over the ear bases (the ears poke up beside the crown). The 10-px brim's right
# end touches the magnifier ring diagonally in code_search_2; accepted (art review), since
# an 8-px brim reads less like a witch hat.
