# December: red body flopping right (k shadow under the fold) and drooping into a white
# pom-pom that rests on the right ear tip without hiding it, and clears the mute slash in
# the effects corner. Two-tone fur brim: cream over an all-W shade row, so the trim still
# reads on the white arctic head.
